  first | exact @GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Small.log_tail | exact GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Small.log_tail | (intros; apply GlobalTheory.CompanionTheory.Ar.Small.log_tail <;> assumption)
